{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"papers\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39223361\",\n      \"kind\": \"review_meta\",\n      \"n_patients\": null,\n      \"center\": \"\",\n      \"recruitment\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41557560\",\n      \"kind\": \"review_meta\",\n      \"n_patients\": null,\n      \"center\": \"\",\n      \"recruitment\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39530963\",\n      \"kind\": \"primary_patient\",\n      \"n_patients\": 22,\n      \"center\": \"Hospital Santa Marcelina, São Paulo, Brazil\",\n      \"recruitment\": \"2015-02至2018-07（手术期间；FF组10例，STN组12例）\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39884164\",\n      \"kind\": \"primary_patient\",\n      \"n_patients\": 23,\n      \"center\": \"Hospital Santa Marcelina, São Paulo, Brazil\",\n      \"recruitment\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40117663\",\n      \"kind\": \"primary_patient\",\n      \"n_patients\": 40,\n      \"center\": \"University of Michigan, Ann Arbor, Michigan, USA\",\n      \"recruitment\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40274625\",\n      \"kind\": \"primary_patient\",\n      \"n_patients\": 70,\n      \"center\": \"University of Michigan, Ann Arbor, Michigan, USA\",\n      \"recruitment\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40648292\",\n      \"kind\": \"primary_patient\",\n      \"n_patients\": 1,\n      \"center\": \"Cleveland Clinic, Cleveland, Ohio, USA\",\n      \"recruitment\": \"个体采集日期未报告；对应受试者亦见NCT05103384研究（2022-07至2024-06）\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42239677\",\n      \"kind\": \"primary_patient\",\n      \"n_patients\": 5,\n      \"center\": \"Cleveland Clinic, Cleveland, Ohio, USA\",\n      \"recruitment\": \"2022-07-22至2024-06-24（NCT05103384研究期间）\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:10634253\",\n      \"kind\": \"primary_patient\",\n      \"n_patients\": 1,\n      \"center\": \"University Hospital, Umeå, Sweden\",\n      \"recruitment\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:10766889\",\n      \"kind\": \"primary_patient\",\n      \"n_patients\": 10,\n      \"center\": \"Groupe Hospitalier Pitié-Salpêtrière, Paris, France\",\n      \"recruitment\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:16139421\",\n      \"kind\": \"primary_patient\",\n      \"n_patients\": 67,\n      \"center\": \"University of Kansas Medical Center, Kansas City, Kansas, USA\",\n      \"recruitment\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:17481921\",\n      \"kind\": \"primary_animal\",\n      \"n_patients\": null,\n      \"center\": \"University of Southern California, Los Angeles, California, USA\",\n      \"recruitment\": \"\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"relations\": [\n    {\n      \"a\": \"PMID:39530963\",\n      \"b\": \"PMID:39884164\",\n      \"relation\": \"unknown\",\n      \"basis\": \"两篇研究均来自Hospital Santa Marcelina（São Paulo），有多位共同作者，包括Godinho、Rocha、Figueiredo和Carlotti，且使用相同的伦理审批编号CAAE: 62418316.9.2004.0066。39530963报告2015年2月至2018年7月期间15例STN-DBS手术，其中12例进入长期随访分析；39884164报告29例STN-DBS候选患者中23例获得了术中LFP记录。两篇研究的中心、伦理审批和患者来源高度相近，存在部分患者重叠的可能，但没有明确的患者交叉名单或论文自述证明二者使用同一批患者，因此判定为unknown，而非same_cohort。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"a\": \"PMID:40117663\",\n      \"b\": \"PMID:40274625\",\n      \"relation\": \"unknown\",\n      \"basis\": \"均为University of Michigan的双侧STN-DBS患者回顾性研究，且共同作者包括Kelvin Chou和Parag Patil。40117663分析40例患者、72个植入物，使用VTA模型研究刺激位置与步态改善的关系；40274625从University of Michigan Surgical Therapies Improving Movement项目数据库提取70例患者，研究电极位置与轴性运动症状的关系。两篇研究具有相同研究中心、相近的手术人群和相关数据来源，40例队列可能是70例队列的子集或与其部分重叠，但现有资料没有提供明确的患者纳入时间、患者编号或队列交叉说明，不能确认partial_overlap或same_cohort。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"a\": \"PMID:40648292\",\n      \"b\": \"PMID:42239677\",\n      \"relation\": \"partial_overlap\",\n      \"basis\": \"有明确的单个患者重叠证据。40648292报告一名65岁男性患者，PD病程6年，双侧STN-DBS术后约8个月，LEDD为1150 mg/day。42239677的5人队列中Subject 1具有相同特征：65岁男性、PD病程6年、DBS术后0.75年、LEDD 1150 mg/day，FOG-Q评分22。两篇研究均来自Cleveland Clinic，使用相同的Cleveland Clinic-Virtual Home Environment（CC-VHE）平台和Medtronic Percept STN-LFP记录系统。42239677还登记了临床试验NCT05103384。40648292的单例与42239677五人队列中的Subject 1高度确定为同一患者，因此属于部分重叠，而不是同一成果的不同版本。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d3af81f8-626c-4984-b22a-0124be0d6f0b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261114T101531050967Z", "elapsed_seconds": 491.688, "completed_utc": "2026-11-14T10:23:42.765606+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "03228fae6899b91bc2fcf43f9871b828844f2685aaab70c6ecb089b29272d477", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261114T101531050967Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "0bdf04532ad